{"id":"n57332-1-7","stage":1,"title":"카메라 · 照相机","scene":"旅行与借物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57332-1-7-1","ko":"다음 주에 여행을 가는데 카메라 좀 빌려줄래?","zh":"下周我要去旅行，能借我相机用一下吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다음","meaning":"下一个、下周的","explanation":"다음：下一个；与 주 合用为 다음 주，表示“下周”。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"1","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}},{"text":"주에","meaning":"周，星期","explanation":"주：周，星期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주에","audio":"/audio/28e7aef02277c8ef3bcb.mp3"}},{"text":"여행을","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여행을","audio":"/audio/8e4d1a5a7460b5dcfa6a.mp3"}},{"text":"가는데","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가는데","audio":"/audio/769c4e4621c06eaf653d.mp3"}},{"text":"카메라","meaning":"照相机","explanation":"카메라：照相机。","readings":[{"term":"카메라","audio":"/audio/6e2b53040cd15b607281.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57332","senseId":"1","lemma":"카메라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"카메라","audio":"/audio/6e2b53040cd15b607281.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"빌려줄래?","meaning":"能借给我吗","explanation":"빌려주다：把自己的东西借给别人使用，之后收回；-ㄹ래? 问对方愿不愿意。这里请求对方把相机借给自己。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빌려줄래","audio":"/audio/7fd3f72560f9e212f6fc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"下一个","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"在顺序或时间上紧接着的；다음 주 指下周。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"周，星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"46811","definition":"从周一至周日七天为一周期计算的时间单位。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6e2b53040cd15b60","term":"카메라","zh":"照相机","audio":"/audio/6e2b53040cd15b607281.mp3","entryId":"57332","definition":"照相用的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"7cc8358d972a7f69","term":"빌리다","zh":"借给（与 주다 合用）","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3","entryId":"17824","definition":"单独的 빌리다 是“向别人借”；빌려주다 在本句是“借给别人”。","pronunciation":["빌리다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给、帮忙做","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"在 빌려주다 中与 빌리다 合用，表示把自己的相机借给对方，并非赠送。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0aea48deea06d795bf42.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57332-1-7-2","ko":"그래, 내일 갖다 줄게.","zh":"好啊，我明天就拿过去给你。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래,","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是。","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日。","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}},{"text":"갖다","meaning":"拿过去","explanation":"갖다：拿、带；갖다 주다 在这里是把相机拿过去交给对方。","readings":[{"term":"갖다","audio":"/audio/48e4cf165dc4c1c6d001.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29738","senseId":"1","lemma":"갖다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갖다","audio":"/audio/48e4cf165dc4c1c6d001.mp3"}},{"text":"줄게.","meaning":"给你","explanation":"주다：给；-ㄹ게 表示说话人对对方作出的承诺。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄게","audio":"/audio/f81c77e211e7de437a74.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"48e4cf165dc4c1c6","term":"갖다","zh":"持，带，戴","audio":"/audio/48e4cf165dc4c1c6d001.mp3","entryId":"29738","definition":"手里握着或身上携带着某物。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d202db561ab690b6675e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.08,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57332","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":36,"sequenceScore":1.5935,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["下周我要去旅行，能借我相机用一下吗？","好啊，我明天就拿过去给你。","觉得这帽子适合你就买了，不知道你喜不喜欢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["下周我要去旅行，能借我相机用一下吗？","好啊，我明天就拿过去给你。","觉得这帽子适合你就买了，不知道你喜不喜欢。"],"answer":1}]}
